---
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro'
import PageBody from '@/components/PageBody.astro'
import PageHead from '@/components/PageHead.astro'
import ProjectCard from '@/components/ProjectCard.astro'
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
import { getAllProjects } from '@/lib/data-utils'

const projects = await getAllProjects()
---

<Layout>
  <PageHead slot="head" title="About" />
  <PageBody>
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About', icon: 'lucide:info' }]} />

    <div class="prose">
        <p class="mb-4">
          Hello, I go by Lilian, if you care my legal name is <span
            style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: 'Redacted Script'"
            >Youlost TheGame</span
          >. I am an incoming freshman at Chennai Mathematical Institute,
          majoring in Math and Physics.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          I tend to engage myself with a lot of things, so most of my interests
          are eclectic and half-baked, but primarily I enjoy literature, music,
          reading about whatever academic discipline caught my eye, and writing.
          Academically, aside from mathematics and physics, I currently enjoy
          philosophy, linguistics/semiotics, sociology and computer science.
        </p>
        <p>
          In daily life I spend my time thinking about the world and trying to
          understand myself, others, and the world around us. In this fashion I
          spend time on rationality (the LessWrong brand of it, even if I have
          great reservations against a lot of LessWrong/Effective Altruism
          adjacent things) and reading whatever brand of philosophy interests me
          at the moment (right now its philosophy of language and literary
          theory).
        </p>
        <p>
          On some more whimsical things, while I don't often watch movies, some
          of my favourites are Loving Vincent and Space Odyssey. In music I love
          noise-rock, emo-esque bands (but I am open to trying out just about
          any genre of music, so feel free to recommend!) and love Radiohead,
          Godspeed You! Black Emperor, Car Seat Headrest, and Willy Rodriguez
          (now disbanded, rip, but drug bug, who was one half of the band, is an
          artist I really like these days). I spend at times too many hours on
          RPGs and Visual Novels, my favourite being Disco Elysium which I only
          recently finished playing.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you find that any of these are also things that interest you, or
          want to just talk, feel free to contact me @lunalgia on discord or
          mail me at lunalgia(at)pm.me!
        </p>
      </div>
    <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl">Some things I am working on</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      {projects.map((project) => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}
    </div>
  </PageBody>
</Layout>
